# Cargo output of the Rust apps (terminal daemon, STUN, capture).
apps/term-host/target/
apps/stun/target/
apps/capture/target/

# Per-agent working memory written by coding agents
**/.claude/agent-memory/

# The reviewed single-file build of the Zalo sidecar is committed on purpose (CI rebuilds it and compares).
!server/internal/bridge/adapters/zalo/sidecar/dist/
